  "body": "Second batch from the mobile audit. Bumps the two safe, self-contained touch-target offenders (verified at 375px):\n\n- Nav **hamburger** 32→40px ([App.jsx](frontend/src/App.jsx))\n- List **filter chips** (All/Workouts/Cardio/Soreness) 30→36px via vertical padding ([ListTab.jsx](frontend/src/components/ListTab.jsx))\n\nNo horizontal overflow; both confirmed enlarged via live measurement.\n\n**Deliberately deferred** (documented so they're not lost): the remaining sub-44px controls — Today exercise-name links (`p-0`), History granularity/pagination buttons, Exercises day buttons — are embedded in layout rows shared between desktop and mobile, so they're better tuned with visual review than blind padding bumps.\n\nBuilt + linted (0 errors).",
